= Jim Prior

[? if con_in_government = 0 : Shadow Employment Secretary. ?][? if con_in_government = 1 : A senior wet in the Cabinet. ?] A Suffolk farmer with a farmer's caution, Prior believes the unions can be reformed but not beaten, and that a government which tries will be broken as Heath's was.

- @moderates
- @step_by_step
- @job_schemes
- @root: Return

@moderates
title: Talk to the union moderates
subtitle: Fewer strikes and a calmer party; the dries grumble.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; strike_wave -= 1; wet_dissent -= 8; dry_dissent += 4; c2_con += 1*(1-dissent)

Prior has quiet drinks with the moderate union leaders, Frank Chapple of the electricians and Terry Duffy of the engineers among them. They have no love for the militants either.

@step_by_step
title: Step-by-step reform
view-if: con_in_government = 1
subtitle: Union power falls without a confrontation.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; union_power -= 6; wet_dissent -= 4; dry_dissent += 3

A modest change to the law, carefully consulted on. The TUC can't call it an assault, and doesn't.

@job_schemes
title: Special employment measures
view-if: con_in_government = 1
subtitle: -1 budget. Cuts unemployment. The dries call it a waste.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; budget -= 1; unemployment -= 0.3; wet_dissent -= 3; dry_dissent += 3; c2_con += 1*(1-dissent)

Prior expands the Youth Opportunities Programme and the temporary short-time working subsidy. The unemployment figures stop rising quite so fast.
